  "Only an empty, fully settled cloud with zero balance can be deleted. Audit and Billing history are retained. Ownership transfer has a different rule: balance must be nonnegative.": "僅可刪除不含資源、已完成結算且餘額為零的雲端；稽核與帳務歷史紀錄仍會保留。所有權移轉的餘額條件不同，允許大於或等於零。",
