  "Test and debug your device directly in the Developer Console — without first building an App, MQTT client or WebRTC Viewer. Select a Product and device to send and receive MQTT messages, read or update Device Shadow state, and view live video over WebRTC. Use these tools to check device behavior and troubleshoot cloud integration before writing your own application. Available tests depend on your permissions and the services enabled for the selected device.": "直接在開發者主控台測試及除錯裝置，無須先建立 App、MQTT 用戶端或 WebRTC 播放器。選擇產品與裝置後，可收發 MQTT 訊息、讀取或更新 Device Shadow 狀態，以及透過 WebRTC 查看即時影像。撰寫自己的應用程式前，可先檢查裝置行為並排查雲端整合問題。可用測試依您的權限與裝置啟用的服務而定。",
  "Test authorization expires after 5 minutes. MQTT credentials renew through a fresh connection; messages during renewal may be missed. Playback stops after 85 seconds. Operations affect your real device.": "測試授權將於 5 分鐘後到期。MQTT 驗證資訊會透過重新連線更新；更新期間可能漏接訊息。播放會在 85 秒後停止。操作會影響真實裝置。",
  "Test protocol": "測試協議",
  "The Billing server estimates costs using the applicable pricing version. The end-of-month forecast is not a final invoice.": "計費伺服器使用適用的定價版本估算成本。月底預測不是最終發票。",
