  "The address may be outdated, or the page may have moved. Use a safe starting point to continue.": "網址可能已過期，或頁面已移動。請從可用的入口繼續操作。",
  "The available balance must be nonnegative (zero is allowed), and Billing must confirm settlement with no unresolved financial work.": "可用餘額須大於或等於零，且 Billing 必須確認已完成結算，沒有待處理的帳務作業。",
  "The balance must first return above the threshold before low-balance monitoring resumes.": "在恢復低餘額監控之前，餘額必須首先恢復到超過門檻。",
  "The billing operation did not complete. No charge was submitted or repeated.": "帳務操作未完成，未送出或重複送出任何扣款請求。",
  "The charge has failed {{count}} consecutive times and will be disabled after the third failure.": "扣款已連續失敗 {{count}} 次，第三次失敗後將停用自動扣款。",
  "The cloud ID and tenant slug do not change when renamed.": "重新命名不會變更雲端 ID 與租戶代碼（slug）。",
  "The cloud owner selects Share cloud and enters the email of a registered, verified developer. The invitee accepts using the matching account; invitations expire after 30 minutes.": "雲端擁有者可選擇「共享雲端」，輸入已註冊且完成驗證的開發者電子郵件。受邀者須使用對應帳戶接受邀請；邀請有效期為 30 分鐘。",
  "The device query service is temporarily unavailable.": "裝置查詢服務暫時無法使用。",
  "The download contains private keys. Keep it secure and do not share it in source control, logs, or support screenshots.": "下載檔案包含私鑰，請妥善保管，勿放入版本控制、日誌或客服截圖中。",
  "The email link is missing its token. Open the original invitation link again.": "電子郵件連結缺少權杖。請再次開啟原始邀請連結。",
