  "The owner can change, disable or remove a member's access. Review pending invitations, resend an unchanged invitation, or cancel it before inviting with a different role or scope. Removing access invalidates Product grants; rejoining does not restore them automatically.": "擁有者可修改、停用或移除成員權限。您可以查看待接受的邀請、重新寄送原邀請，或先取消後再使用不同角色或範圍重新邀請。移除權限會使產品授權失效，重新加入也不會自動恢復。",
  "The owner receives the global account activation email; no tenant password is created.": "擁有者會收到全域帳戶啟用郵件，不會建立租戶密碼。",
