  "Viewer provides read-only access to selected Products or the entire cloud. For example, give a camera developer access to Home Camera while keeping other Products outside their scope. Admin and Member use their existing cloud-role permissions, not the Viewer's read-only Product scope; neither grants ownership or Billing access.": "檢視者僅能讀取指定產品或整個雲端的資料。例如，可授予攝影機開發者「家用攝影機」產品的權限，其他產品仍不可見。管理員與成員沿用既有雲端角色權限，不受檢視者的產品唯讀範圍限制；兩者均不包含所有權或帳務存取權。",
