  "Test and debug your device directly in the Developer Console — without first building an App, MQTT client or WebRTC Viewer. Select a Product and device to send and receive MQTT messages, read or update Device Shadow state, and test live video and two-way audio over WebRTC. Use these tools to check device behavior and troubleshoot cloud integration before writing your own application. Available tests depend on your permissions and the services enabled for the selected device.": "直接在開發者主控台測試及除錯裝置，無須先建立 App、MQTT 用戶端或 WebRTC 播放器。選擇產品與裝置後，可收發 MQTT 訊息、讀取或更新 Device Shadow 狀態，並透過 WebRTC 測試即時視訊與雙向音訊。撰寫自己的應用程式前，可先檢查裝置行為及排查雲端整合問題。可用測試依您的權限與裝置啟用的服務而定。",
  "Test authorization lasts 11 minutes. MQTT credentials renew through a fresh connection; messages during renewal may be missed. WebRTC playback runs for up to 10 minutes and may briefly reconnect as media sessions renew. Operations affect your real device.": "測試授權有效期為 11 分鐘。MQTT 驗證資訊會透過重新連線更新；更新期間可能漏接訊息。WebRTC 播放最長 10 分鐘，媒體工作階段更新時可能會短暫重新連線。操作會影響真實裝置。",
