  "Count bytes sent by TURN to recipients, including each viewer. Relay processing is included. No extra minute or download charge on these bytes. Direct P2P media is free.": "計算 TURN 傳送給每位接收者的位元組數。費率已含中繼處理，這些流量不另計分鐘或下載費；直接 P2P 媒體傳輸免費。",
  "Count each accepted publish once. Payload traffic is included; no separate MQTT bandwidth fee.": "每次成功接收的發布計為一次。已含訊息內容流量，不另收 MQTT 頻寬費。",
  "Count outgoing file bytes once, including retries and multiple recipients. Excludes TURN and MQTT traffic. Inbound transfer is included.": "依對外傳送的檔案位元組數計算，包含重試及不同接收者。不含 TURN 和 MQTT 流量；傳入流量已包含。",
  "Count successful data API requests only. Excludes Shadow, WebRTC signaling, OTA task dispatch and object operations already covered above. Console administration and authentication are included.": "僅計算成功的資料 API 請求。不含已在其他項目計費的 Shadow、WebRTC 信令、OTA 任務派送和物件操作；主控台管理與驗證已包含。",
  "Count successful object GET and HEAD requests; each range request is a read. Delivered bytes use the download rate below.": "計算成功的物件 GET 和 HEAD 請求；每次範圍請求計為一次讀取。傳送位元組數另依下方下載費率計算。",
  "Count successful object writes and multipart part writes. A multipart completion is one further write. Upload bandwidth is included.": "計算成功的物件寫入及分段上傳；完成分段上傳另計一次寫入。已含上傳頻寬。",
