  "US East example. CloudWatch uses compressed archive bytes, so the byte basis differs from this RTK proposal.": "AWS 美國東部區域範例。CloudWatch 依壓縮後封存容量計費，與本提案的位元組基準不同。",
  "US East. AWS also charges signaling channels and messages. Different unit: our proposal follows delivered bytes; Akamai transfer costs inform the rate.": "AWS 美國東部區域亦對信令通道和訊息收費。本提案按傳送位元組數計費，費率參考 Akamai 傳輸成本，計價單位不同。",
