  "Use recorded log bytes × configured retention days / 30. This proposal follows the existing retention estimate, not compressed archive size.": "以記錄的日誌位元組數乘以設定保留天數，再除以 30。本提案沿用現有保留量估算，不依壓縮封存容量計算。",
