  "From the authorized factory gateway, submit request_id, devid and csr_pem with the production-run JWT as a Bearer token. If sent, service_options must match the production run.": "由核准的工廠閘道送出 request_id、devid 與 csr_pem，並以生產批次 JWT 作為 Bearer 權杖。若另提供 service_options，其內容必須與生產批次相符。",
  "An authorized user with device-management permission creates a production run for this Cloud and Product, then securely delivers its short-lived authorization to the approved factory gateway.": "由具備此雲端與產品裝置管理權限的使用者建立生產批次，再將有期限的授權安全地交給核准的工廠閘道。",
  "A device private key stays on the device. Send its CSR, device ID and a production-run JWT from the authorized factory gateway using mTLS.": "裝置私鑰保留在裝置上。由已授權的工廠閘道使用 mTLS，送出裝置 CSR、裝置 ID 和生產批次 JWT。",
