  "Count one committed object creation by immutable object key or version. Failed PUTs and retries without a new object are excluded.": "每個已完成建立的物件，依不可變的物件識別碼（Object Key）或版本計一次；失敗的 PUT 與未建立新物件的重試不計。",
  "Count outgoing video media bytes, including retries. OTA uses its separate successful-download meter.": "計算傳出的影片媒體位元組數，包含重試。OTA 另以成功下載項目計量。",
  "Count successful video object GET and HEAD requests. OTA origin reads and CDN requests are internal costs, not customer read fees.": "計算成功的影片物件 GET 與 HEAD 請求。OTA 來源站讀取及 CDN 請求屬內部成本，不向客戶收取讀取費。",
  "Count successful video object writes. OTA artifact writes have a separate meter; upload bandwidth is included.": "計算成功的影片物件寫入。OTA 檔案寫入另行計量；上傳流量已包含。",
  "Count the first durable assignment per campaign and device, whether it starts from a notification or device poll. Retries add no task fee.": "每個活動與裝置組合只計首次持久化的任務指派，無論由通知或裝置輪詢觸發；重試不增加任務費。",
  "Count the release artifact size once on the first authenticated downloaded report for each deployment and exact artifact. Failed transfers, URL grants and Range retries add no customer bytes.": "每次部署及確切檔案以首次通過驗證的 downloaded 回報，按發行檔案大小計一次。失敗傳輸、URL 授權及 Range 重試不增加客戶計費位元組。",
  "Firmware artifact verified by a target device.": "目標裝置已驗證的韌體檔案。",
