  "This device is bound but cloud provisioning is not complete. Start or retry Provision in Devices & credentials.": "此裝置已綁定，但尚未完成雲端佈建。請在「裝置與驗證資訊」中開始或重試佈建。",
  "Live tests are unavailable: the device-scoped credential exchange and broker revocation integration are not ready. No live connection has been made.": "即時測試無法使用：裝置專屬的驗證資訊交換與 Broker 權限撤銷整合尚未就緒，尚未建立任何即時連線。",
  "Your read-only role does not grant device control or media playback.": "您的唯讀角色沒有裝置控制或媒體播放權限。",
