  "Test authorization expires after 5 minutes. MQTT credentials renew through a fresh connection; messages during renewal may be missed. Playback stops after 85 seconds. Operations affect your real device.": "测试授权将于 5 分钟后到期。MQTT 凭证会通过重新连接更新；更新期间可能漏接消息。播放会在 85 秒后停止。操作会影响真实设备。",
