  "The cloud ID and tenant slug do not change when renamed.": "重新命名不会变更云端 ID 与租户代码（slug）。",
  "The cloud owner selects Share cloud and enters the email of a registered, verified developer. The invitee accepts using the matching account; invitations expire after 30 minutes.": "云端所有者可选择「共享云端」，输入已注册且完成验证的开发者电子邮件。受邀者须使用对应账户接受邀请；邀请有效期为 30 分钟。",
  "The device query service is temporarily unavailable.": "设备查询服务暂时不可用。",
  "The download contains private keys. Keep it secure and do not share it in source control, logs, or support screenshots.": "下载文件包含私钥，请妥善保管，勿放入版本控制、日志或客服截图中。",
  "The email link is missing its token. Open the original invitation link again.": "电子邮件链接缺少令牌。请再次打开原始邀请链接。",
