  "The latest synchronization failed. The last valid snapshot remains available.": "最新的同步失败了。最后有效的快照仍然可用。",
  "The owner can change, disable or remove a member's access. Review pending invitations, resend an unchanged invitation, or cancel it before inviting with a different role or scope. Removing access invalidates Product grants; rejoining does not restore them automatically.": "所有者可修改、停用或移除成员权限。您可以查看待接受的邀请、重新发送原邀请，或先取消后再使用不同角色或范围重新邀请。移除权限会使产品授权失效，重新加入也不会自动恢复。",
  "The owner receives the global account activation email; no tenant password is created.": "所有者会收到全局账户启用邮件，不会创建租户密码。",
  "The payment method does not yet have merchant-initiated charge capability; the save button remains disabled and no charge will be submitted.": "此付款方式尚未开通商家主动扣款功能，保存按钮维持停用，也不会提交扣款请求。",
  "The payment service has not completed automatic-charge eligibility verification, so no charge was submitted.": "付款服务尚未完成自动扣款资格验证，因此未提交扣款请求。",
