  "The role determines what can be done, and the scope determines which Products, Regions, Groups, or Devices can be managed.": "角色决定了可以做什么，范围决定了可以管理哪些产品、地区、组或设备。",
  "The secret is required when saving or re-enabling the subscription; it is never displayed after submission.": "保存或重新启用订阅时须提供签名密钥，提交后不会再显示。",
