  "The unique owner has switched. Recovery must finish forward; there is no switch-back action. The new owner must set up their own payment method and consent after finalization.": "所有者已切换。后续恢复任务必须继续完成交接，无法切回原所有者。交接完成后，新所有者须设置自己的付款方式并同意扣款。",
