  "Count bytes sent by TURN to recipients, including each viewer. Relay processing is included. No extra minute or download charge on these bytes. Direct P2P media is free.": "计算 TURN 发送给每位接收者的字节数。费率已含中继处理，这些流量不另计分钟或下载费；直接 P2P 媒体传输免费。",
  "Count each accepted publish once. Payload traffic is included; no separate MQTT bandwidth fee.": "每次成功接收的发布计为一次。已含消息内容流量，不另收 MQTT 带宽费。",
  "Count outgoing file bytes once, including retries and multiple recipients. Excludes TURN and MQTT traffic. Inbound transfer is included.": "依对外发送的文件字节数计算，包含重试及不同接收者。不含 TURN 和 MQTT 流量；传入流量已包含。",
  "Count successful data API requests only. Excludes Shadow, WebRTC signaling, OTA task dispatch and object operations already covered above. Console administration and authentication are included.": "仅计算成功的数据 API 请求。不含已在其他项目计费的 Shadow、WebRTC 信令、OTA 任务派送和对象操作；控制台管理与验证已包含。",
  "Count successful object GET and HEAD requests; each range request is a read. Delivered bytes use the download rate below.": "计算成功的对象 GET 和 HEAD 请求；每次范围请求计为一次读取。发送字节数另依下方下载费率计算。",
  "Count successful object writes and multipart part writes. A multipart completion is one further write. Upload bandwidth is included.": "计算成功的对象写入及分段上传；完成分段上传另计一次写入。已含上传带宽。",
