  "US East example. CloudWatch uses compressed archive bytes, so the byte basis differs from this RTK proposal.": "AWS 美国东部区域示例。CloudWatch 依压缩后归档容量计费，与本提案的字节基准不同。",
  "US East. AWS also charges signaling channels and messages. Different unit: our proposal follows delivered bytes; Akamai transfer costs inform the rate.": "AWS 美国东部区域亦对信令通道和消息收费。本提案按发送字节数计费，费率参考 Akamai 传输成本，计价单位不同。",
  "Unbind {{deviceName}} ({{deviceId}}) from {{email}}? This account loses test access. Device identity, certificates and other accounts are preserved.": "要解除测试设备 {{deviceName}}（{{deviceId}}）与 {{email}} 的绑定吗？该账户将失去测试访问权；设备身份、证书及其他账户的绑定不受影响。",
  "Usage meter exists": "已具备用量计量",
