  "I agree that when the balance falls strictly below the configured threshold, the selected payment method may be used to add funds automatically, subject to the daily attempt, daily amount, and cooldown limits.": "我同意当余额低于设置阈值时，系统可使用所选付款方式自动充值，并遵守每日尝试次数、每日充值金额及冷却时间限制。",
