  "Research reference prices": "研究参考价",
  "Research references are not approved customer charges. OTA has four approved unit prices, but they are not effective yet. An existing meter does not mean charging is enabled.": "研究参考价并非已核准的客户收费。OTA 四项单价虽已核准，但尚未生效；已有计量数据也不代表已启用收费。",
  "São Paulo GET reference. RTK includes successful clip HEAD operations, so counted operations differ.": "圣保罗区域 GET 参考价。RTK 也计入成功的视频片段 HEAD 操作，因此计量事件不同。",
  "São Paulo direct internet egress proxy. Clip delivery bytes need a separate validated RTK fact.": "圣保罗区域直接互联网传输的替代参考价。视频片段传输量仍需经 RTK 独立验证。",
  "São Paulo hot-storage reference. Actual RTK clip byte-time metering still needs qualification.": "圣保罗区域热存储参考价。RTK 视频片段的字节时间计量仍待验证。",
  "São Paulo hot-storage reference. Approved RTK price uses physical OTA object byte-time.": "圣保罗区域热存储参考价。已核准的 RTK 单价按 OTA 对象实际占用的字节时间计算。",
  "São Paulo reference. AWS uses 1 KB units; RTK proposes 1 KiB units, so byte boundaries differ.": "圣保罗区域参考价。AWS 使用 1 KB 单位，RTK 草案使用 1 KiB 单位，两者字节阈值不同。",
  "São Paulo reference. Provider PUT requests also include events that are not RTK successful object creations.": "圣保罗区域参考价。供应商 PUT 请求也包含不属于 RTK 成功创建对象的事件。",
  "São Paulo reference. Provider PUT requests and successful RTK business writes are related but not identical events.": "圣保罗区域参考价。供应商 PUT 请求与 RTK 成功的业务写入相关，但不是相同的事件。",
  "São Paulo transfer-only proxy. AWS Kinesis Video Streams also bills TURN minutes, which cannot be converted to GiB without bitrate and viewer count.": "圣保罗区域仅含传输量的替代参考价。AWS Kinesis Video Streams 另按 TURN 分钟收费；缺少比特率与观众数时无法换算成 GiB。",
  "São Paulo, first paid tier. AWS also charges publish and delivery separately; its 5 KB units differ from RTK raw deliveries.": "圣保罗区域首个付费阶梯。AWS 也分别计收发布与发送，但其 5 KB 单位与 RTK 原始发送次数不同。",
  "São Paulo, first paid tier. AWS rounds by 5 KB units; RTK counts raw accepted publishes, so large messages are not equivalent.": "圣保罗区域首个付费阶梯。AWS 按 5 KB 单位进位；RTK 计算实际接收的发布次数，因此大消息不能直接等同。",
  "The four OTA customer unit prices are approved but have no effective date yet. OTA is not charged at these prices until an active Billing rate card includes them.": "四项 OTA 客户单价已核准，但尚未设置生效日。正式账务价卡纳入这些费率之前，不会按这些单价收取 OTA 费用。",
  "The other prices use the highest eligible public benchmark found in the reviewed sources. They are planning references, not a change to your active rate card.": "其他价格采用已审查来源中符合条件的最高公开基准，仅供规划参考，不会变更您当前生效的价卡。",
  "This page does not verify your Cloud’s effective Billing rates. Your contract, active rate card and invoice determine actual charges; these references are not an invoice or spend forecast.": "本页未验证您云端当前生效的账务费率。实际费用以合同、生效中的价卡与发票为准；这些参考价不是发票，也不是支出预测。",
