  "Selected CloudFront Asian delivery regions outside China. Raw CDN bytes and retries differ from RTK first verified logical download.": "CloudFront 指定的中国以外亚洲交付区域。原始 CDN 字节数与重试流量，和 RTK 首次验证的逻辑下载量不同。",
